(Northfield College Student Handbook 2026-2027) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Welcome to Northfield College. This handbook explains the rules that apply to all undergraduate) Tj T*
(students. The academic year has two semesters. The autumn semester runs from 1 September to 20) Tj T*
(December, and the spring semester runs from 12 January to 30 May. The winter break lasts from) Tj T*
(21 December to 11 January. Classes start at 8:30 am and the last lecture ends at 5:30 pm.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The Registrar's Office is in the Main Building, room 104, and is open from 9 am to 4 pm on) Tj T*
(weekdays. It issues transcripts, bonafide certificates and duplicate ID cards. Students must) Tj T*
(update their address in the student portal within 14 days of moving. Official messages are sent) Tj T*
(to the college email address only, so students should read it every day.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
