(Registration and fees) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Course registration for the autumn semester opens on 15 July and closes on 10 August. Students) Tj T*
(can add or drop a course during the first two weeks of the semester without a penalty. After) Tj T*
(that, a dropped course is shown as W \(withdrawn\) on the transcript.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The tuition fee for the 2026-2027 year is 84,000 rupees, paid in two equal parts. The first) Tj T*
(part is due on 25 August and the second part on 5 January. A late payment fee of 1,500 rupees) Tj T*
(applies to each part paid after its due date. Students who need more time can ask the Finance) Tj T*
(Office for an instalment plan before the due date; the plan allows up to four payments. The) Tj T*
(Finance Office is in the Main Building, room 112. Fees can be paid online by card or bank) Tj T*
(transfer, or at the cash counter of the Finance Office.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
