(Attendance and leave) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Students must attend at least 75 percent of the classes of each course to sit its final exam.) Tj T*
(Attendance is recorded at the start of every class; a student who arrives more than 10 minutes) Tj T*
(late is marked absent. Medical leave needs a certificate from a registered doctor, submitted) Tj T*
(within 7 days of the student's return. Approved medical leave does not count as absence.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A student whose attendance falls below 75 percent receives a warning email, and can appeal to) Tj T*
(the Head of Department within 5 working days. Students may take up to 3 days of personal leave) Tj T*
(per semester with the approval of their academic adviser. Every student is given an academic) Tj T*
(adviser in the first week of the first semester.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
