(Exams and grading) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Final exams take place in the last two weeks of each semester. Students must bring their) Tj T*
(student ID card to every exam; without it, they cannot enter the exam hall. Mobile phones must) Tj T*
(be switched off and left in the bags at the front of the hall. A student who misses an exam for) Tj T*
(a medical reason can take a make-up exam, which is held in the first week of the next semester.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Grades use a 10-point scale. The pass mark for a course is 40 out of 100. Re-evaluation of an) Tj T*
(exam paper can be requested within 10 days of the results, for a fee of 500 rupees per paper.) Tj T*
(If the re-evaluation raises the mark by 5 or more points, the fee is returned.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
