(Scholarships and awards) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The Merit Scholarship covers 50 percent of the tuition fee for students with a grade point) Tj T*
(average of 8.5 or higher in the previous year. The Need-Based Grant covers up to 100 percent of) Tj T*
(the tuition fee for students from families with an annual income below 3 lakh rupees.) Tj T*
(Applications for both open on 1 June and close on 30 June.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A student can hold only one scholarship at a time. Scholarship holders must keep a grade point) Tj T*
(average of at least 7.0 to keep the scholarship in the next year. The Dean's List is published) Tj T*
(at the end of each semester and includes the top 5 percent of students in each program.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
