(Conduct and graduation) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Plagiarism in any assignment leads to a mark of zero for that assignment; a second case is) Tj T*
(reported to the Academic Integrity Committee. Students must not record a lecture without the) Tj T*
(permission of the teacher. Smoking is not allowed anywhere on campus.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(To graduate, a student needs 160 credits, including 12 credits of electives and a final-year) Tj T*
(project. The graduation ceremony is held every year in the third week of July. Students must) Tj T*
(return all library books and pay any dues before they receive their degree certificate. Degree) Tj T*
(certificates are posted to students who cannot attend the ceremony, for a fee of 300 rupees.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
